msgid "vehicle/A134_M24E2_SuperChaffee"
msgstr ""
"A legendary light tank that features great maneuverability. The vehicle "
"causes a decent amount of damage per minute and has good depression and "
"elevation angles, which allows it to use terrain irregularities to its "
"advantage in battle."

msgid "vehicle/G158_VK2801_105_SPXXI"
msgstr ""
"This vehicle is armed with a high-caliber gun and features nice armoring, "
"although this affects its dynamics and maneuverability. The tank is somewhat"
" clunky, which makes it extremely effective when ramming light-armored "
"vehicles."

msgid "vehicle/R160_T_50_2"
msgstr ""
"A light tank that is perfect for active reconnaissance at all stages of "
"battle. Its small silhouette and high speed allow it to avoid being hit, "
"which is extremely important given its modest firepower."

msgid "vehicle/R197_KV_1S_MZ"
msgstr ""
"This is the only vehicle at its tier featuring an inverse autoreloader. It "
"is at its best when causing burst damage to enemy vehicles or providing "
"support fire to allies."
